      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "У нас есть дубликаты. Сейчас подпишем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have duplicate copies. We will sign now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Хорошо, я вас за столиком жду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good, I am waiting for you at the table.'",
      "gap": 0.45
